{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>became an archer.</b> He shoots arrows with a bow." "<b>An archer.</b> Named for the craft — like חַמָּר, גַּמָּל, צַיָּד; therefore the shin has a dagesh. He would sit in the desert and rob passersby — that is what is meant by ״his hand against everything,״ and so forth."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:48.518533978Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}